{"unit_id":"tag:095R:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为有限（finite）且有限表示（finitely presented）的概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n设<MATH_0002>为诺特环（Noetherian ring）。如果<MATH_0003>为可构造（constructible）的集合（sets）、阿贝尔群（abelian groups）或<MATH_0004>模（modules）的层（sheaf），它在<MATH_0005>上，则<MATH_0006>也如此。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"态射的性质，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示","context":"态射的性质，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射的对象，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"本引理的映射，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环","context":"系数环的类型，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"层的性质，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"层的取值，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"层的取值，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"层的取值，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"本引理的对象，词表尚未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:095R:proof","translation":"由引理<REF_0001>，只需在<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>仿射（affine）时证明这一点。由引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>，可以基变换（base change）到任何仿射概形（affine scheme），只要它满射（surjective）到<MATH_0003>。由引理<REF_0004>，这将问题归约为有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）的情形（因为加厚（thickening）导致平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑斯（topoi）的等价（equivalence），甚至导致小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）景（sites）的等价，见定理<REF_0005>）。有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）的情形即为引理<REF_0006>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"thickening","target_term":"加厚"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0004>tale","target_term":"平展"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"首句的归约条件，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"证明的操作，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"操作的目标，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"目标的条件，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"态射的性质，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"第一处平展性质，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"归约后的映射，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"thickening","target_term":"加厚","context":"括号中的几何构造，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"第二处平展性质，词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":