{"unit_id":"tag:09YU:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的有向系统（directed system）的极限（limit），其过渡态射（transition morphisms）仿射（affine）。我们假设<MATH_0002>拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated），对所有<MATH_0003>均成立。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 集合（sets）的可构造层（constructible sheaves）的范畴（category），其对象在<MATH_0004>上，是集合（sets）的可构造层（constructible sheaves）的范畴（categories）的余极限（colimit），其对象在<MATH_0005>上。\n<STRUCT_0003> 可构造（constructible）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的范畴（category），其对象在<MATH_0006>上，是可构造（constructible）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的范畴（categories）的余极限（colimit），其对象在<MATH_0007>上。\n<STRUCT_0004> 设<MATH_0008>为诺特环（Noetherian ring）。可构造层（constructible sheaves）的范畴（category），其对象取值于<MATH_0009>模（modules）且在<MATH_0010>上，是可构造层（constructible sheaves）的范畴（categories）的余极限（colimit），其对象取值于<MATH_0011>模（modules）且在<MATH_0012>上。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"directed system","target_term":"有向系统"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"transition morphisms","target_term":"过渡态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环"},{"source_term":"constructible sheav